# Production: VITE_API_BASE_URL stays unset because the frontend is served
# behind Caddy, which reverse-proxies /api/* to the backend (same-origin).
# See Caddyfile and Dockerfile.
#
# The backend's address is configured at RUNTIME via the API_UPSTREAM env var
# on the Railway frontend service (read by Caddy, not baked into the bundle).
#
# Only set VITE_API_BASE_URL here if deploying WITHOUT a reverse proxy — but
# note that doing so requires backend CORS config and breaks multi-tenancy
# (the backend resolves the store from the Host header).
